{"product_id":"whole-world","title":"Whole World","description":"\u003cp\u003eSing around the world, from high in the mountains to low in the valleys, in every town and city, with all the fish, birds, trees and flowers of the Earth. Featuring informative endnotes on the environment and global warming, this book and CD combo is adapted from the popular gospel spiritual. This Music CD features well-known singalong song with an environmental twist. It is printed on ancient forest friendly paper and includes great tips on how to keep our earth healthy and happy.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 260 x 260\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Fred Penner | Chris Corr\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781846860850\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45684556005529,"sku":"BLK-1-9781846860850","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68aec71d41d90_Whole_World_Fred_Penner___Chris_Corr.jpg?v=1756578056","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/whole-world","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}